file=Ops & Delivery/handoff/operational/principles/handoff-principles.md · h·p:handoff \· principles=> Universal-only.\n\n1. **Never silent.** Every handoff has an envelope.\n2. **Echo-confirmed within SLA.**\n3. **Context capped** — memory reference for anything longer than cap.\n4. **Receiver never assumes** — every handoff self-contained.\n5. **Blocking flag mandatory.**\n6. **Every handoff logged.**\n7. **Silent-handoff patterns surface as system issue**, not individual blame.\n8. **Critical path = longest chain**, not busiest team.\n9. **Never delete history.**\n10. **Verification-before-completion inherited.** Shared OS `memory-practices` inherited for context capping.\n